<title>THAILAND: Trade resumes in National Finance, Ekachart shrs.</title>
<headline>Trade resumes in National Finance, Ekachart shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said trading of National Finance and Securities and Ekachart Finance and Securities Plc shares could resume at 0345 GMT on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>The firms had earlier announced merger plans and trade had been halted.</p>
<p>Ekachart was up 2.25 baht to 25.25 after the resumption and National Finance gained 1.25 to 39.50.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
